          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.2 TCP 连接建立：三次握手"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "12-tcp-连接建立三次握手"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "三次握手过程涉及 SYN 和 ACK 两个状态："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "客户端发送 SYN 报文给服务端。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "服务端收到 SYN 报文后，回应 SYN + ACK 报文。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "客户端收到服务端的 SYN + ACK 报文后，回应一个 ACK 报文。\n三次握手完成后，TCP 客户端和服务器端成功建立连接，可以开始传输数据。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "配图说明（三次握手）：示意图左侧为客户端，右侧为服务器。服务器首先被动打开（bind）。随后出现三条带箭头的连线，依次为："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "客户端 → 服务器：SYN"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "服务器 → 客户端：SYN-ACK"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "客户端 → 服务器：ACK\n最终状态标注为“连接建立”。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.3 TCP 连接终止：四次挥手"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "13-tcp-连接终止四次挥手"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "四次挥手过程涉及 FIN 和 ACK 两个状态："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "客户端首先调用 close，发送 FIN 报文，表示数据发送完毕（主动关闭）。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "服务端接收到 FIN 报文，返回 ACK 报文。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "服务端返回确认 FIN 报文（确认 close）。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "客户端确认 FIN，返回 ACK 报文，连接中断。\n由于每个方向都需要一个 FIN 和一个 ACK，因此通常需要 4 个报文。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "配图说明（四次挥手）：示意图左侧为“客户”，右侧为“服务器”，标题为“TCP 连接终止需四个分节”。时序如下："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "客户（主动关闭）→ 服务器（被动关闭）：FIN M"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "服务器 → 客户：ACK M+1（此时 read 返回 0）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "服务器（close）→ 客户：FIN N"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "客户 → 服务器：ACK N+1\n为什么终止需要四次分节？"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "TCP 的连接可靠性核心不是“不丢包”，而是“超时重传”。四次挥手保证了连接关闭存在延迟，防止连接关闭太快，导致重发的数据收不到确认。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "1.4 TCP 的可靠性"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "14-tcp-的可靠性"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "TCP 提供面向连接的、可靠的字节流服务。面向连接意味着两个使用 TCP 的应用（通常是一个客户和一个服务器）在彼此交换数据包之前必须先建立 TCP 连接。广播和多播不能用于 TCP。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "TCP 通过下列方式提供可靠性："
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "应用数据被分割成 TCP 认为最适合发送的数据块（UDP 则保持数据长度不变）。TCP 传递给 IP 的信息单位称为报文段（segment）。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "当 TCP 发出一个段后，启动定时器等待确认；若不能及时收到确认，将重发该报文段。收到数据后也会发送确认；延迟确认功能打开时由定时器触发确认时间点。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "TCP 保持首部和数据的检验和。如果收到段的检验和有差错，TCP 将丢弃该报文段且不确认，等待发端超时并重发。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "由于 IP 数据报可能失序，TCP 报文段也可能失序；必要时 TCP 对收到的数据重新排序，以正确顺序交给应用层。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "由于 IP 数据报可能重复，TCP 接收端必须丢弃重复数据。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "TCP 提供流量控制。连接每一方都有固定大小的缓冲空间，接收端只允许另一端发送缓冲区所能接纳的数据，防止较快主机使较慢主机缓冲区溢出。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、TCP 与 UDP 的对比"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "二tcp-与-udp-的对比"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.1 TCP 的优缺点"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "21-tcp-的优缺点"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "优点：可靠、稳定。体现在三次握手建立连接，以及数据传输过程中的确认、窗口、重传、拥塞控制机制；数据传完后还会断开连接以节约系统资源。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "缺点：慢、效率低、占用系统资源高、易被攻击。建立连接需要时间；确认、重传、拥塞控制等机制会消耗大量时间；每个连接都会占用 CPU、内存等硬件资源；确认机制和三次握手机制也使其容易遭受 DOS、DDOS、CC 等攻击。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.2 UDP 的优缺点"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "22-udp-的优缺点"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "优点：快、比 TCP 稍安全。UDP 没有握手、确认、窗口、重传、拥塞控制等机制，是无状态传输协议，传输速度快；没有 TCP 的这些机制，被攻击者利用的漏洞相对较少（但仍无法避免攻击，例如 UDP Flood）。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "缺点：不可靠、不稳定。没有 TCP 的可靠机制，网络质量不好时容易丢包。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "2.3 核心区别"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "23-核心区别"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "align": [
          null,
          null,
          null
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "是否连接"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": [
                  {
